# The App Store page's list (Library → App Store): one GitHub repo with a release zip per line,
# "owner/repo Name", the name optional. Lines under [Games] are on its Games tab, the rest on Apps;
# older firmware skips the [Games] line and lists them all. The device fetches this file; see
# docs/internals.md#q2-shelf.
# Firmware before the tabs (1.8.7 and older) reads only the first 16 apps, so the games, last, are the first left out.
# Firmware 1.9.0 and older reads only the first 32 entries, with a user's own lines after them.
DiamondBond/q2-rockbox Rockbox
DiamondBond/q2-rockbox-themes Rockbox Themes
